OL,3,GNEWSADeliberate fire suspected at
OL,4,Aformer town hall
OL,5,
OL,6,FHampshire & Isle of Wight Fire & Rescue
OL,7,FService said the fire, that had spread
OL,8,Fto the roof, was brought under control
OL,9,Fin the early hours with crews from
OL,10,FCowes and East Cowes monitoring the
OL,11,Fbuilding and dampening down remaining
OL,12,Fhotspots.
OL,14,FPeople living nearby were urged to keep
OL,15,Fdoors and windows closed due to the
OL,16,Fsmoke and stay away from the area.
